<title>JAPAN: Sogo shares up on Oriental Land hopes.</title>
<headline>Sogo shares up on Oriental Land hopes.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Sogo Co Ltd were bid-only in Wednesday morning trade, as hopes that the listing of Oriental Land later this year may inspire a bullish mood in the stock market spurred interest in Sogo, traders said.</p>
<p>Sogo, a department store operator, holds shares in Oriental Land, they said.</p>
<p>The Sogo shares were bid-only at 523 yen at 0102 GMT, compared with the last traded price of 498 yen on Tuesday.</p>
